## 3 Kubernetes - Create a ReplicaSet with 3 Replicas

---
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: ReplicaSet
metadata:
  name: pathnex-replicaset
spec:
  replica: 3
  selector:  
   matchLabels:
     app: pathnex-app
   template:
     metadata:
       app: pathnex-app
     spec:
       containers:
         - name: app
           image: nginx
           ports:
             - containerPort: 80
---

